{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00690","headline":"郊庙歌辞 德明兴圣庙乐章 迎神 · 李舒","name":"郊庙歌辞 德明兴圣庙乐章 迎神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元尊九德，佐尧光宅。\n烈祖太宗，方周作伯。\n响怀霜露，乐变金石。\n白云清风，髣髴来格。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李舒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}